description_text:
&lt;p&gt;📍London / UK Remote | 💰 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/documents/engineering-progression-framework-v4-0.pdf&quot;&gt;Staff Backend Engineer (L60)&lt;/a&gt; £130,000 - £170,000 + Equity&amp;nbsp;+ &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/technology&quot;&gt;Technology&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Engineering&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Engineering Teams:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
